  "body": "Set on a freehold 203sqm corner section with approximately 163sqm of thoughtfully designed living space, this modern four-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home combines practical family living with low-maintenance convenience in a sought-after Orewa location.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor centres around a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a welcoming hub for everyday life and entertaining alike. Sliding doors extend the living space to a covered deck with pergola, offering an inviting outdoor setting with a peaceful reserve outlook. A heat pump in the living area provides year-round comfort, while the tandem internal access garage incorporates the laundry and offers additional storage space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second family living area provides valuable flexibility for growing families, creating an ideal space for children, a study area or simply a separate retreat. Four bedrooms are positioned around this central living zone, including the master bedroom with its own ensuite. Panel heaters in the master bedroom and two additional bedrooms provide added comfort during the cooler months.\r\n\r\nConstructed with a timeless combination of brick and weatherboard cladding, the home offers both durability and low-maintenance appeal. Double glazing throughout, excellent insulation and modern construction techniques enhance thermal efficiency and year-round comfort, delivering a home designed for comfortable and efficient living.\r\n\r\nResidents have access to a well-equipped shared recreation area, featuring a swimming pool, heated spa pool, tennis court, playground, basketball facilities and visitor parking, adding everyday convenience and a relaxed lifestyle element to this modern townhouse setting.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Orewa Primary, Orewa College, local childcare facilities, cafés, shops, motorway access and Orewa Beach, this home presents an excellent opportunity to enjoy modern living with the added benefit of outstanding community facilities and peaceful reserve surroundings.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are becoming increasingly difficult to find. Contact us today for more information or visit our upcoming open homes.",
